  "solution": "**Given:**\n\nDiscounts = 8%, 16%, 3%\n\n**Formula used:**\n\nEffective Price% = 100 × (1 − d₁/100) × (1 − d₂/100) × (1 − d₃/100)\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n⇒ Effective Price% = 100 × (1 − 8/100) × (1 − 16/100) × (1 − 3/100)\n\n⇒ 100 × 0.92 × 0.84 × 0.97\n\n⇒ 100 × 0.749616\n\n⇒ 74.96%\n\n**∴ Effective price = 74.96% of Marked Price.**",
